# =====================================================================
#  DON QUIXOTE OF LA MANCHA - English text: vocabulary and system messages
#  Each /VOC line hangs English words on a Spanish word group of base.paw:
#  "V COGER: GET TAKE" means the verb group COGER is typed GET or TAKE.
#  Words are cut to 5 letters, as in PAW: NORTHEAST would be NORTH, so
#  the diagonals are only NE, NW, SE and SW.
# =====================================================================

/VOC
DIR S: S SOUTH
DIR E: E EAST
DIR O: W WEST
DIR NE: NE
DIR NOROESTE: NW
